#### xschem config for netlisting a sheet as an includable top-level .subckt.
#### Sources the project rc, then turns on xschem's "LVS netlist: top level is
#### a .subckt" option so the top sheet's .subckt/.ends are live and a long pin
#### list keeps its '+' continuation lines (a plain `klt netlist --block` only
#### uncomments the first line of a wrapped pin list; see design/README.md).
source [file join [file dirname [info script]] xschemrc]
set lvs_netlist 1
